cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "IMPaCT Synergy Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Measurement framework for the Minimal Principles for Consciousness (MPC) of
  IMPaCT. The Python pipeline computes five null-anchored estimators (RAM,
  PDI, NAS, IIM, SRPI) from EEG, fMRI and simulated data and combines them
  under a declared protocol into a three-valued, missingness-safe exclusion
  verdict (EXCLUDED, MPC_CONSISTENT, UNDETERMINED). It includes MPC-Bench,
  white-box simulated systems for validating the estimators and the verdict,
  and runs locally or on HPC (HLRS Hunter).
